@startuml trust-boundaries
!include _theme.iuml
left to right direction

package "Your machine" as Local {
  rectangle "rup-flow CLI" as CLI
  database "Project files" as Files
  rectangle "PlantUML container\n127.0.0.1 only" as PlantUML
}

cloud "Agent provider\nits own terms and privacy policy" as Provider
cloud "Container registry\nimage pulled once" as Registry

CLI --> Files : reads and writes\ninside the folders you choose
CLI --> PlantUML : diagram sources
Provider ..> Files : prompts and files the agent reads
Registry ..> PlantUML : first start only

note bottom of Local
  rup-flow has no account, no analytics
  and no service of its own.
end note
@enduml
